>## Convert a bigint to an int16 (truncating).
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>##
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>## bigintToInt16(x) returns x reduced modulo 2^16 and reinterpreted as a signed two's-complement int16. Values outside [-2^15, 2^15-1] wrap silently with no exception.
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>## Total.
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>##
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>## @availableSince 0.15
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra keyword.other.documentation.directive.hydra
#                  ^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>## @requirement convertsInRange bigintToInt16 returns the int16 with the same numeric value as the bigint, for positive and negative values within the int16 range.
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#   ^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra keyword.other.documentation.directive.hydra
#               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>## @requirement wrapsTwosComplementOutOfRange bigintToInt16 on a value outside the int16 range ([-2^15, 2^15-1]) wraps silently to the corresponding two's-complement int16, with no exception, at both the positive and negative (all-bits-set) boundary.
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#   ^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra keyword.other.documentation.directive.hydra
#               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>primitive bigintToInt16 : ∀.bigint → int16
