#   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra keyword.other.documentation.directive.hydra
#                  ^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>## @requirement returnsUnsignedByteValues binaryToBytes returns the bytes of the binary data as a list of int32 values in [0, 255], preserving byte order, including byte values above 127 (which remain unsigned, not reinterpreted as negative), and the empty list for empty binary data.
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
